{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882470/extras/character5.png?t=1744808301\" />.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">'Who wouldn't want to punch someone who pisses them off?'</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Martial Arts x Psycho-Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just a few toes into the future</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Born with monstrous physical abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yahiro Ako.\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She enters the world of underground fighting through a certain opportunity: ......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From there, the wheels of her life begin to turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Is it destruction or glory that lies beyond the release of violence?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882470/extras/character6.png?t=1744808301\" />Ako Yahiro ,OneFistOneKill </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882470/extras/\u65b0\u5782\u76f4\u30ab\u30d7\u30bb\u30ebONEFIST4556.png?t=1744808301\" />Undefeated in 25 underground fights and undefeated in amateur boxing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A hard puncher with tremendous physical strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She has overwhelming power, but is unstable for her age. ............</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Makoto Jinnai, the Superhuman</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882470/extras/\u307e\u3053\u3068s1.jpg?t=1744808301\" />Undefeated in 12 professional MMA fights and undefeated in professional kickboxing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Overwhelming achievements and phenomenal performance overseas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A superhuman fighter who has attracted the attention of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, he actually has a difficult personality. ............</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ryuga Oryuu ,BadBoy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882470/extras/\u65b0\u5782\u76f4\u30ab\u30d7\u30bb\u30ebONEFIST4556\u96c4\u7adc.png?t=1744808301\" />Three MMA pro wins and a new star athlete for the upstart organization GOUKEN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He is a lightweight, but with his speed, combinations, and jiu-jitsu techniques</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She is the same age as Ako.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a novel game about girls with a martial arts theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You advance the story by making choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The difficulty level is quite low, and the game progresses quickly with an emphasis on the story experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There will be at least two endings.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2882470?t=1744808301","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2882470?t=1744808301","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882470/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744808301","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882470/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744808301","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3232720,"descrip